This library formalizes standard heat-kernel and rough-initial-measure analysis.
Its rough-data framework and Chen–Dalang convolution estimates are attributed to:
Le Chen and Robert C. Dalang, Moments and growth indices for the nonlinear
stochastic heat equation with rough initial conditions, Annals of Probability
43 (2015), 3006–3051.

